# Whole-repository: this corpus stores fetched bytes and hashes them, so git must never translate
# line endings on the way in OR on the way out. The per-extension rules below are kept for documentation.
* -text

# Evidence bytes are provenance: sources/ layers and harvest responses carry sha256 sidecars computed
# from the exact downloaded bytes, so line-ending conversion would make every future hash check lie.
# (core.autocrlf=true is a Windows default, not this project's decision -- RD-143.)
founders_playbook/01_companies/**/sources/** -text
founders_playbook/00_universe/harvest/** -text
*.txt -text
*.htm -text
*.html -text
*.sgml -text
*.sgm -text
*.json -text
*.meta.json -text
